@startuml

|Member|
start
:Return the borrowed copy;

|Librarian|
:Receive the copy;
:Identify the loan;

|System|
:Retrieve loan information;
:Check if the return is late;

if (Return late?) then (yes)
  :Activate extension point\n"late return";
  :Suspend the member;
else (no)
endif

:Close the loan;
:Check if the copy is reserved;

if (Copy reserved?) then (yes)
  |Librarian|
  :Set the copy aside;

  |System|
  :Notify the member who reserved it;
else (no)
  :Make the copy available;
endif

|Librarian|
:Complete the return process;

stop
@enduml